{"id": "wong-civil-settlement-accounting", "title": "What San Francisco could collect from Walter Wong’s settlement", "seconds": 50.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "d1960661145bcdcf", "words": 151, "beats": [{"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco paid Walter Wong’s company for four emergency contracts.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.85, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,118,107.26", "label": "Payments on four emergency contracts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.86, 1.09, 1.43, 1.74, 2.15, 2.32, 2.57, 3.05]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Mohammed Nuru admitted steering two of those jobs to Wong.", "t0": 3.97, "t1": 6.92, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "nuru", "text": "emergency contract process", "mark": "emergency"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.84, 1.2, 1.56, 1.77, 1.87, 2.12, 2.46, 2.6]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A separate planter invoice went through the Clean City Coalition.", "t0": 7.04, "t1": 9.99, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "invoice", "text": "Hallidie Plaza Planters", "mark": "Planters"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.46, 0.83, 1.24, 1.43, 1.66, 1.76, 2.03, 2.29]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The coalition’s copy shows $99,988, stamped paid.", "t0": 10.11, "t1": 14.24, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$99,988", "label": "Hallidie Plaza planter invoice"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.73, 1.13, 1.41, 1.72, 1.81, 2.13, 2.52, 3.26, 3.73]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Board approved a settlement worth $1,772,271.64.", "t0": 14.46, "t1": 18.13, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "terms", "context": "Approved settlement", "heading": "What the settlement included", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"label": "purchases", "value": "$1,291,095.26", "icon": "money"}, {"label": "unpaid invoices", "value": "$163,526.38", "icon": "money"}, {"label": "penalties and fees", "value": "$317,650", "icon": "money"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.36, 0.76, 0.85, 1.27, 1.53, 1.89, 2.18, 2.5, 2.8, 3.22]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Wong agreed to cancel two unpaid Jelani House invoices.", "t0": 18.25, "t1": 21.28, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$163,526.38", "label": "Two canceled Jelani invoices"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.61, 0.71, 1.1, 1.33, 1.73, 2.16, 2.43]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The City also credited Wong for trash cans it had received.", "t0": 21.4, "t1": 24.33, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "terms", "text": "Credit for Goods Received by the City", "mark": "Credit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.41, 0.76, 1.19, 1.46, 1.6, 1.92, 2.21, 2.32, 2.43]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "That credit covered the full $317,650 in penalties and fees.", "t0": 24.45, "t1": 26.57, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$317,650", "label": "Penalties and late fees covered by credit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.51, 0.81, 0.98, 1.08, 1.53, 1.67]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The agreement required $1,221,811.32 in cash.", "t0": 26.69, "t1": 30.05, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["settlement value", "$1,772,271.64"], "b": ["cash due", "$1,221,811.32"], "kicker": "Separate amounts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.61, 1.05, 1.34, 1.57, 1.86, 2.12, 2.47, 2.83, 2.94]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The first installment was $221,811.32.", "t0": 30.27, "t1": 33.79, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "terms", "context": "Approved settlement", "heading": "Two cash installments", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"label": "first installment", "value": "$221,811.32", "icon": "money"}, {"label": "remaining installment", "value": "$1,000,000", "icon": "money"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.43, 1.11, 1.31, 1.55, 1.81, 2.15, 2.69, 3.09]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The remaining million was supposed to come from federal forfeiture.", "t0": 33.91, "t1": 36.86, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,000,000", "label": "Federal forfeiture under the agreement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.58, 0.92, 1.06, 1.46, 1.59, 1.82, 2.01, 2.37]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Wong received a year of probation in January 2025.", "t0": 36.98, "t1": 40.27, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "review", "text": "1 year of probation", "mark": "probation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.7, 0.79, 0.99, 1.06, 1.66, 1.79, 2.35, 2.65]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "After judgment, the court docket listed a payment card.", "t0": 40.39, "t1": 43.24, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "docket", "text": "Payment Record Card", "mark": "Payment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.95, 1.11, 1.39, 1.78, 2.09, 2.16, 2.5]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The entry gives no amount or payee. City receipts remain unverified.", "t0": 43.36, "t1": 47.33, "shot": "s13", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "docket", "text": "Payment Record Card", "mark": "Card"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.43, 0.71, 0.91, 1.24, 1.35, 2.18, 2.51, 2.93, 3.26]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 47.45, "t1": 49.56, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"a": "The City’s purchases", "b": "How the settlement added up", "c": "Did the cash reach the City?"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}